son with all the rewards, and if he incapacitates them, the rewards might go too, if he flips back, he&#39;ll need to get rid of those tokens on his other side, maybe he gets healing on his other side but loses a token when hit?</p><p>Voidsoul: Definitely a flippy floppy one, might just flip whenever you flip an objective regardless, maybe he tries to steal rewards, as to flip one reward card needs to exist somewhere...</p><p>Faultless: Looks like he only flips once, on his other side he might mess around with even numbers, like &quot;if a hero target would be dealt an odd amount of damage, increase that damage by 1&quot; or maybe he becomes the Faulltless that helps Expat and Setback?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Anyway, these are my guesses, feel free to make your own!</p>",
